replace('validation.tex','UC12; BR13 & Shipment/event data design & AT14: Known signed delivery event advances state once; an older transit event cannot undo Delivered. Unknown references enter exceptions.','UC12; BR13,15 & Shipment/event data design & AT14: Signed delivery advances once; old transit cannot undo Delivered. Temporary failure permits retry; authorised permanent failure closes Shipped and schedules a full refund once. Carrier return restocks only inspected saleable goods once; lost goods do not. Unknown references enter exceptions.')
